File Reading Examples/C# API/*.dll
File Reading Examples/C# API/*.DLL
File Reading Examples/C# API/*.delsys
File Reading Examples/C# API/*.shpf
File Reading Examples/MATLAB API/*.delsys
File Reading Examples/MATLAB API/*.shpf
File Reading Examples/MATLAB API/dependencies/
File Reading Examples/Python API/*.delsys
File Reading Examples/Python API/*.shpf
File Reading Examples/Python API/dependencies/

